# BehaviorOS Governance Layer
- Read .agent_state.json at session start
- Follow 7-step protocol: bos_select_dna → bos_resolve_truth → create-mission → delegate → bos_run_audit → record-learning
- Block any action that skips bos_select_dna
- Source of truth: docs/PROTOCOL.md

## Enforcement
- MCP server blocks ALL action tools if protocol is violated
- .agent_state.json persists protocol state between sessions
